            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="readme-term">Recovered</td>
              <td>Actions that existed before the current review week, are now On Track, are Improving or Goal Met, and were updated during the review week. This is an activity-based indicator, not a saved week-over-week status comparison.</td>
            </tr>

            <tr class="readme-section-row">
              <td colspan="2">Performance Terms</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="readme-term">Baseline Performance</td>
              <td>The KPI result recorded when the action plan starts. It is the reference point used to evaluate movement.</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td class="readme-term">Current Performance</td>
              <td>The latest KPI result entered for the action plan.</td>
